<p>
  The regression tests of the PAD framework, of four kinds. The sandbox suites render cases
  inside the running request; the Pages and Common suites fetch real pages over HTTP - Pages
  from regression2, which runs with _common switched off, Common from regression3, the pages
  that use it; the scan crawls every page of every application against its stored copy. Each
  line reports the last run - Test on a suite's own page reruns it.
</p>

<table border="1" cellpadding="4" cellspacing="0">
  <tr><th>suite</th><th>last run</th><th>ran</th><th>status</th></tr>
  {rows}
    <tr>
      <td><a href="{$link}">{$name}</a></td>
      <td>{$result}</td>
      <td>{$ran}</td>
      <td>{$status}</td>
    </tr>
  {/rows}
</table>